    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d246">

                <pb facs="0422" n="392" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54Guat/pg392"/>

                <head>246. Telegram From Operation PBSUCCESS Headquarters in
                        Florida to the CIA
                        Station in Guatemala<anchor n="1" xml:id="d246-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>[<hi rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>], <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1954-06-28T05:20:00+00:00">June 28, 1954,
                        0520Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>4458. 1. Urge you exercise every means to have [<hi rendition="#italic">name not
                        declassified</hi>] remove STANDEL–1
                    before noon 28 June failing this prevail upon STANDEL–1 to accept Calligeris cease fire conditions.</p>
                <p>2. FYI. There remains no choice but fight unless STANDEL–1 comes out immediately against communism accepting terms
                    announced and call cease fire for forming new govt with Calligeris.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d246-f2"/> To
                    do otherwise would be to surrender our present advantages and possibly fall
                    victim of Arbenz Communist intrigue.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
